# nieqes, "less", the SUBTRACTIVE direction: past the half hour Maltese names
# the COMING hour and takes the remaining minutes off it ("It-tmienja nieqes
# kwart" == 07:45, "L-għaxra nieqes ħamsa" == 09:55).  preply.com, "Telling
# the time in Maltese"; languagephrases.com, "Telling Time In Maltese
# Language"; en.wiktionary.org, nieqes ("less", of time).
nieqes
